<title>USA: Specialty Foods Corp completes Gai's Baking sale.</title>
<headline>Specialty Foods Corp completes Gai's Baking sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMONT, Ill. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialty Foods Corp said Wednesday it completed the sale of its Gai's Seattle French Banking Co unit to  United States Bakery for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>Specialty Foods is a food processing holding company with annual sales of about $2 billion.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
